# 324-cylindrical-hole-face-on-pin: added by the parity loop from a Fusion probe
# Joint (Joint Constraint): grounded pin A, r5 h20 cylinder at the origin; plate B 40x12x4 built at x 30..70, y 0..12 with a r5 hole at (36,6). Cylindrical joint from the middle of the hole face to the middle of the pin face, slid 5 mm and turned 90 deg.
